Verenu FluidAudio speech bridge

AcousticVocabulary.swift adapts the acoustic rescoring orchestration from
FluidAudio VocabularyBoostingSession.swift at revision
0b1f46289fe27d95b5e66ad8be46e64f5ee02ae7, distributed under Apache-2.0.
FluidAudio: https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio

Verenu modifications add a private tokenizer directory, remove content
logging, preserve primary punctuation with conservative alignment checks,
and restrict the English booster to explicitly English dictation.

FluidAudio and its third-party license notices accompany the Swift package.
The selected FluidInference model cards declare CC-BY-4.0. The English CTC
booster model card also contains conflicting Apache-2.0 prose. Downloads
retain the exact pinned model card and any published license files. Model
authors and source revisions are recorded in local_stt/fluid_assets.json.
Model weights are downloaded only on explicit user action and are not
bundled in Verenu. Whisper GGML weights are from ggerganov/whisper.cpp and
OpenAI Whisper, under the MIT license. Portable Whisper uses CPU whisper.cpp,
not WhisperKit, CoreML, or an Apple Neural Engine implementation.
